<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 305-4 V HAMPSHIRE (156) - LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 305-4 V HAMPSHIRE (156) - LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHAMPTON, England 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 305</p>
<p>for four at lunch in reply to Hampshire's first innings total of</p>
<p>156 on the second day of a three-day match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Hampshire 156, Australia 305-4 (M.Waugh 111 not out,</p>
<p>M.Taylor 109).</p>
</text>
